abstract: "A practical approach to contracting agents. Every artifact that instructs an executor running beyond your supervision is a contract with a jinni; one failure geometry runs under all of them and one authoring discipline answers it: precision on ends, floors and acceptance, generality on means, the because carried always, and a pre-authorized stop-and-report."
